#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5110
msgid "Collect customer emails from the checkout page and an optional signup popup, so abandoned carts can be followed up. Collected emails are listed on the Abandoned Carts page."
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5115
msgid "Email collection"
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5116
msgid "When on, emails typed at checkout and in the popup are saved with a cart snapshot. When off, the whole cart abandonment feature stops: nothing is added to your store pages, the popup does not show and no background task runs."
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5122
msgid "Mark cart as abandoned after"
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5123
msgid "minutes of inactivity"
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5124
msgid "A cart with a known email and no activity for this long is marked as abandoned."
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5132
msgid "Count as recovered within"
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5133
msgid "days"
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5134
msgid "An order only counts as a recovery when the matching cart was last active within this many days. Older carts are left untouched, so a customer coming back a month later is recorded as a new sale rather than a recovered cart."
msgstr ""

#: front-end/cart-abandonment/brikpanel-cart-abandonment.php:5142
msgid "WhatsApp message"
msgstr ""

